## Origin

2026-08-15 — **prevents incident 1 and incident 5.** Incident 1: two days of IP
Scanner, PUM, and dashboard work never reached the browser because the embedded
`ui-dist` bundle was never redeployed; the served-bundle check makes that state
impossible to report as complete, because the disk and served asset hashes
would not have matched. Incident 5: build time became the dominant cost of each
iteration and verification was dropped to compensate; this rule names slow
loops as defects and closes the "skip verification to save time" escape.
